# Party chat choice test, part 2 (docs/re-party-chat.md section 9): a fresh boot loading the save part 1
# wrote (chat_choice_yes.plan or chat_choice_no.plan; run with --save <that save>). The pick should be in
# the loaded flags (word 0x48: 0x10 = 0x244 told the truth, 0x20 = 0x245 dodged). Then flag 0x1C (Lucia
# has explained the delivery) is poked on: after "yes" Y plays the chat that remembers the truth, after
# "no" it plays the vanilla hint for that stage.
include boot_from_save
wait 60
peek u16 0x020B6BE4 map
dump 0x02204620 0x5C flags_loaded
dump 0x02204668 0x4 choice_word_loaded
poke u32 0x02204620 0x10000802
wait 30
press Y 3
wait 120
shot r_1
press A 3
wait 90
shot r_2
press A 3
wait 90
shot r_3
press A 3
wait 90
shot r_4
